{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/OriSilver/status/2102817977812824335","id":"2102817977812824335","text":"Claude Opus 5.5 + Maxfusion MCP + Blender is Ultimate control\n\n- I installed Blender. That was my whole job\n\n- I dropped in a video whose shot style and flow I wanted\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 broke it down and pulled 15 frames per second\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 rebuilt every shot in Blender (camera angles, movement, blocking) and exported a 30s MP4 blockout\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 used that blockout as the reference for Seedance 2.5, swapped in my characters, and wrote the prompts that stop Seedance from copying Blender's rough render\n\nThe result is below\n\nMaxFusion MCP Made it all happen: the prompting, the images, the edit, everything! \n\nWhat do you think?","raw_text":{"text":"Claude Opus 5.5 + Maxfusion MCP + Blender is Ultimate control\n\n- I installed Blender. That was my whole job\n\n- I dropped in a video whose shot style and flow I wanted\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 broke it down and pulled 15 frames per second\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 rebuilt every shot in Blender (camera angles, movement, blocking) and exported a 30s MP4 blockout\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 used that blockout as the reference for Seedance 2.5, swapped in my characters, and wrote the prompts that stop Seedance from copying Blender's rough render\n\nThe result is below\n\nMaxFusion MCP Made it all happen: the prompting, the images, the edit, everything! \n\nWhat do you think?","display_text_range":[0,644],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[277,300],"id":"2102817919226814464","display":"pic.x.com/SSun2Vdvx2","original":"https://t.co/SSun2Vdvx2","replacement":"https://x.com/OriSilver/status/2102817977812824335/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"OriSilver","url":"https://x.com/OriSilver","id":"834775279629373440","followers":6917,"following":645,"likes":33045,"media_count":2547,"name":"Ori Silver","description":"Founder @maxfusionai Create winning AI ads at scale\nGet 15% off - https://lp.max